  <footer class="bg-[#10251b] text-white/65"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-6 px-5 py-10 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between lg:px-8"><div><img src="/logo.svg" alt="屏東公園" class="h-12 w-auto brightness-0 invert"/><p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-xs leading-6">非官方景點資訊網站；內容僅供旅遊規劃參考，實際開放、交通、活動與設施狀況請以主管機關及現場公告為準。</p></div><div class="flex gap-5 text-xs"><a href="#top">回到頁首</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a href="#" id="cookie-settings">Cookie 設定</a></div></div></footer>

  <div id="cookie-panel" class="fixed bottom-4 left-4 right-4 z-[60] hidden max-w-lg rounded-2xl border border-[#173226]/15 bg-white p-5 shadow-2xl sm:left-auto sm:w-[420px]" role="dialog" aria-label="Cookie 設定"><h2 class="font-black">Cookie 與分析設定</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#173226]/65">本站使用 GA4 了解匿名化的整體瀏覽情況。你可以在瀏覽器隱私設定中限制第三方 Cookie；本網站不提供帳號登入或個人資料庫。</p><button id="cookie-close" class="mt-4 rounded-full bg-[#173226] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white">知道了</button></div>

  <script is:inline>
    const openCookie = document.getElementById('cookie-settings');
    const panel = document.getElementById('cookie-panel');
    const closeCookie = document.getElementById('cookie-close');
    openCookie?.addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); panel?.classList.remove('hidden'); });
    closeCookie?.addEventListener('click', () => panel?.classList.add('hidden'));
  </script>
